    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27460" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δισκ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pitch the quoit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίσκον . . στιβαρώτερον οὐκ ὀλίγον περ
					ἢ οἵῳ . . ἐδίσκεον ἀλλήλοισιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.188
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακρὰ δισκήσαις</span>
			<i>having made a</i> long <i>throw,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				2.35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴ τις δισκίοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(1).828
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Sparta</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be hurled,</i> of a person, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1268
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ευθήσεται</span>
			); of a squid, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.227
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Bianor</span>).</div>
